{"id": 997997, "slug": "succubus-roulette", "name": "Succubus Roulette", "name_original": "Succubus Roulette", "description": "<p><strong>SUCCUBUS ROULETTE</strong> is a tabletop Nsfw game that attempts to re-design the infamous game of Buckshot roulette replacing the traditional pump-action shotgun with a magic deck of cards. This extra something :v, and more importantly the different mechanics in dealing the cards compared to a shotgun offers a fresh take on the classic and deadly game of chance.</p><p>The game takes place after the events of Doki Doki Tri-Line Quest, where the protagonist is summoned to a place that exists between everything and nothing to participate in a sacred game among succubi. An ancient god awaits—will you meet with them?</p><p><strong>FEATURES</strong>:</p><p>- 15 to 20 minute playthrough.</p><p> - Is not that Immersive or grounded as buckshot roulette but is honest work :0. </p><p> - Unscripted rounds that offer unpredictable yet controllable outcomes, with a fair amount of replay value. </p><p> - A ruthless yet fair AI, that makes decisions based on what's on the table, rather than under it.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-02-18", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-02-21T08:43:25", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/0ac/0ac8c49811e4a1586288efdbdd33c675.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f58/f58ebd8ff820077c02b23705968d1035.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 5, "added_by_status": {"owned": 3, "toplay": 2}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 198, "alternative_names": [], "me